    {
      "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005-sec-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4 Application of amendment",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005#sec-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The amendment made by Schedule 1 applies to films that\ncommence to be made after the commencement of that Schedule.\n\n\n\n(2) However, the amendment has no effect to the extent to which the\nrights created by the amendment would be inconsistent with the\nrights arising under a contract entered into before the\ncommencement of the amendment.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The amendment made by Schedule 1 applies to films that\ncommence to be made after the commencement of that Schedule.\n\n\n\n(2) However, the amendment has no effect to the extent to which the\nrights created by the amendment would be inconsistent with the\nrights arising under a contract entered into before the\ncommencement of the amendment.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005-sec-4-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005-sec-4-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "854dd91122d162204d3213cbd1f9ef86bb85d50e1ee84fb12a428cc48b588d03"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005#sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 Application of amendment",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The amendment made by Schedule 1 applies to films that\ncommence to be made after the commencement of that Schedule.\n\n\n\n(2) However, the amendment has no effect to the extent to which the\nrights created by the amendment would be inconsistent with the\nrights arising under a contract entered into before the\ncommencement of the amendment.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005-sec-4-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
