      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The amendment made by Schedule 1 applies to films that\ncommence to be made after the commencement of that Schedule.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The amendment made by Schedule 1 applies to films that\ncommence to be made after the commencement of that Schedule.",
