      },
      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, the amendment has no effect to the extent to which the\nrights created by the amendment would be inconsistent with the\nrights arising under a contract entered into before the\ncommencement of the amendment.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, the amendment has no effect to the extent to which the\nrights created by the amendment would be inconsistent with the\nrights arising under a contract entered into before the\ncommencement of the amendment.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005-sec-4"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005-sec-4-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "35eac3341053bf902f1b181917a568b3e4a1391ae1109e8de96dc13d811491ad",
      "skos:note": "Amendment does not affect rights inconsistent with pre-existing contracts."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005#sec-4-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(2) Application of amendment",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, the amendment has no effect to the extent to which the\nrights created by the amendment would be inconsistent with the\nrights arising under a contract entered into before the\ncommencement of the amendment.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005-sec-4-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-film-directors-rights-act-2005-sec-4-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
